# Ōzakura pilot v2 — Chapter 2 "Kendo" (source script; syntax in the header of ch01.ozs)
# Built from production/pilot-v2/scene-outline.md (Ch2, approved Oct 24) and the pilot-notes fix list
# (2, 5, 6, 7, 8, 13, 25, 28, 29, 30, 32, P1–P5). Chapter-2-only syntax:
#   @phone me|chie text        a text message in the chat UI (unvoiced)
#   @wear kohei kendo|work|school  the outfit Kōhei's face windows show from here on (default school)
#   @shake                      screen shake
#   @anim name                  a short animated moment: plays img/anim/name.mp4 once, then holds the CG `name`
#   @insert name ... @insert end   a manga insert, shown panel by panel (style guide §4a). Inside it:
#   @panel description          starts the next panel; the description is for cold readers and the art brief.
#                               The panel's lines are lettered on the page art; they also go to the backlog,
#                               and spoken ones are voiced when the panel opens.
# Dialogue rewrite (Oct 24, per reviews/ch2/dialogue-diagnosis.md): "|| TODO" = Japanese to redo for revised
# English; lines with no #c2_ ID are new. Change log: ch02-rewrite-log.md (delivered with this file).

== c2_tuesday | Tuesday night at Hoshino Kitchen
@chapter 2 | Kendo
@card Tuesday, April 8
@bg bg_classroom_day
@bgm daily
> On Tuesday, Mizuno learns the other half of the class's names.  #c2_0001
> Every so often during class, the back of my neck prickles, the way it does on the floor when someone's measuring the distance between us.  #c2_0002
> When I turn around, she's always looking at the board.  #c2_0003
@bg bg_restaurant_night
@wear kohei work
> Tuesday is also a shift. Five-thirty to close at Hoshino Kitchen, the family restaurant by the station: the dish pit, the drink bar, and the register whenever the register needs a body.  #c2_0004
manager: "Fujisawa-kun! Table four wants the check, table nine wants water, and the dishwasher's making the noise again!" || ふじさわくん！ 四番さんお会計、九番さんお水、あと食洗機がまたあの音出してる！  #c2_0005
kohei(neutral): "On it." || 今、行きます。  #c2_0006
manager: "Lifesaver!" || 助かるー！  #c2_0007
> That's one. The manager says it about nine times a night.  #c2_0008
> Akane's dinner is in the fridge at home with a note on the lid. At seven she sends me a photo of the empty container. A minute later she sends a second one, closer up, in case I had questions.  #c2_0009
@sfx door_slide
@bgm natsuki
@show natsuki school_laugh c
> At eight, the automatic door slides open on five girls from Two-B, still in uniform and still loud from karaoke. Mizuno's in the middle of them.  #c2_0010
classmate: "Nacchan, you have to get the strawberry parfait. Everybody gets the parfait." || なっちゃん、いちごパフェは絶対だよ。みんな頼むんだから。  #c2_0012
natsuki<surprised>: "…Fujisawa?" || ……ふじさわ？  #c2_0014
> I'm holding a tray of empty glasses and wearing the Hoshino Kitchen apron, the one with a cartoon chef on the pocket.  #c2_0015
natsuki<grin>: "You work here." || ここでバイトしてるんだ。  #c2_0016
kohei(neutral): "Tuesdays, Thursdays, Sundays." || 火、木、日な。  #c2_0017
natsuki<curious>: "And you tie your apron like a {hakama|pleated kendo trousers}." || しかも、エプロンを袴みたいに結んでる。  #c2_0018
> I look down. The strings cross in front and finish in a flat knot below my stomach.  #c2_0019
kohei(deadpan): "It stays tied." || ほどけないんだよ。  #c2_0020
@hide natsuki
> I put them in the big booth by the window. When I come back with the order tablet, Mizuno has the menu open to the very last page.  #c2_0022
@show natsuki school_curious c
natsuki<curious>: "Do you check ID for the kids' plate?" || お子様ランチって、年齢確認する？  #c2_0023
kohei(surprised): "…No." || ……しない。  #c2_0024
natsuki<smile>: "Then one kids' plate, please. With the flag." || じゃあ、お子様ランチひとつ。旗つきで。  #c2_0025
classmate: "Nacchan, you're sixteen!" || なっちゃん、十六でしょ！  #c2_0026
natsuki<grin>: "He said they don't check." || 確認しないって、言ったもん。  #c2_0027
> She hands me the menu without looking away from me.  #c2_0028
@show natsuki school_smile
> I laugh. Right there in the middle of the floor, with the tablet in one hand and her menu in the other.  #c2_0029
@hide natsuki
> The kids' plate comes out with a little paper flag stuck in the dome of rice. Mizuno photographs it from three angles before she touches it.  #c2_0030
> Around eight-forty the girls pile out in a clump, waving at Mizuno through the window.  #c2_0033
classmate: "Nacchan, aren't you coming?" || なっちゃん、帰らないの？  #c2_0034
@show natsuki school_smile c
natsuki<smile>: "I live right by the station. I'm not done with my flag." || 私、駅のすぐそばだから。旗、まだ堪能してないし。  #c2_0035
@hide natsuki
> At nine, the manager turns the sign on the door around and decides not to notice the one customer left in the booth.  #c2_0036
> She talks while I wipe tables. About the town, mostly.  #c2_0037
@show natsuki school_curious c
natsuki<curious>: "Is the mountain always that close? From the station it looks like you could walk there." || あの山って、いつもあんなに近いの？ 駅から見ると、歩いて行けそう。  #c2_0038
kohei(neutral): "It's farther than it looks." || TODO  #c2_0039
natsuki<smile>: "What about the {taiyaki|fish-shaped cake} stand by the north exit?" || 北口のたい焼き屋さんは？  #c2_0040
kohei(neutral): "Red bean's good. Don't get the custard. They burn it." || あんこはうまい。カスタードはやめとけ。焦がすから。  #c2_0041
natsuki<laugh>: "Head first or tail first?" || 頭から？ しっぽから？  #c2_0042
kohei(deadpan): "Don't start." || その話はやめろ。  #c2_0043
> So I tell her other things instead. Which convenience store has the drink fridge that freezes everything solid. How the river floods the lower path in June, and the herons stand on the bike racks like they're waiting for a train. Where the wind comes down off the mountains strongest, if you want petals in a picture.  #c2_0044
> She doesn't ask why a second-year works three shifts a week. People usually do, the first time. Then they get careful with me.  #c2_0046
> When I start putting chairs up on the tables, she gets up without a word and starts on the other side of the room.  #c2_0047
manager: "Lifesaver!" || 助かるー！  #c2_0048
> That's nine.  #c2_0053
manager: "…Wait. Do you work here?" || ……あれ？ うちの子だっけ？  #c2_0049
natsuki<grin>: "I'm new." || 新人です。  #c2_0050
> The manager nods like that settles it and goes back to the register.  #c2_0051
> I laugh so hard I have to put the chair down.  #c2_0052
natsuki<smile>: "See you tomorrow, Fujisawa. Wednesday." || じゃあね、ふじさわ。また明日。水曜日。  #c2_0054
> She goes out with the little paper flag in her blazer pocket.  #c2_0055
@hide natsuki
@bgm -
> I finish the floor. I count out the register. I walk home up the hill.  #c2_0056
> Somewhere around the bridge I notice my throat's a little rough, and it takes me most of the way home to work out why. I've been talking. For an hour, about taiyaki and herons, to someone I met yesterday.  #c2_0057

== c2_dojo | First practice
@card Wednesday, April 9
@bg bg_dojo
@wear kohei kendo
@bgm practice
> The dojo smells like it always does in April: old wood, old sweat, and the cedar walls warming up in the sun after a long winter.  #c2_0059
> Four days a week, for two hours, there's exactly one problem in front of me, and I'm allowed to solve it with my whole body.  #c2_0060
> Takatsuki is already on the floor when I come in, doing {suburi|practice swings} alone at the far end. Every swing is the same swing: same height, same speed, same snap at the bottom. Watching him is like watching a diagram of kendo.  #c2_0061
@show takatsuki kendo_calm r
takatsuki: "Fujisawa." || ふじさわ。  #c2_0062
kohei(neutral): "Takatsuki." || たかつき。  #c2_0063
takatsuki: "Your hakama is tied off center." || 袴の紐が、中心からずれている。  #c2_0064
kohei(deadpan): "It's the same knot as always." || いつもと同じ結び方だ。  #c2_0065
takatsuki: "Yes. It has been off center for a year." || そうだ。一年前から、ずっとずれている。  #c2_0066
@hide takatsuki
@show kirishima kendo_calm l
kirishima: "Line up." || 整列。  #c2_0068
> Kirishima-senpai, the captain, is the only person I know who can quiet a room by not raising his voice. As far as anyone can tell, nothing has ever surprised him.  #c2_0069
kirishima: "Welcome back. The first-years start trials next week. We have one new member already: a second-year transfer. Mizuno." || おかえり。一年の体験入部は来週からだ。新入部員はもう一人いる。二年の転入生だ。みずの。  #c2_0070
@show natsuki kendo_smile r
natsuki: "Mizuno Natsuki, second year. Most recently from Sendai. I've done kendo since I was seven, and this is my sixth dojo. Who do I get to fight first?" || TODO  #c2_0071
> A couple of the third-years laugh. She looks pleased about it.  #c2_0072
kirishima: "Good." || TODO  #c2_0073
> She's in a faded indigo {keikogi|kendo jacket} and hakama, her hair up in a long ponytail. The gi has been washed so many times it's gone soft and pale at the seams. Old equipment. Well loved.  #c2_0074
kirishima: "Warm-ups and suburi. After the break, bogu: {kirikaeshi|a drill of nonstop strikes}, {waza|technique} drills, then {shiai-geiko|practice matches}." || 準備運動と素振り。休憩のあと、防具をつけて、切り返し、技の稽古、それから試合稽古。  #c2_0076
kirishima: "Fujisawa. You'll take Mizuno. Find out what she has." || ふじさわ。みずのの相手をしろ。どれだけやるか、見てやれ。  #c2_0077
@show takatsuki kendo_surprised c
takatsuki: "Captain, I could take her, if—" || 主将、僕が相手をしても……  #c2_0078
kirishima: "You'll take the first-years when they come, Takatsuki. They'll need someone with patience." || たかつきには、一年が来たら任せる。辛抱強いやつが要る。  #c2_0079
takatsuki: "…" || -  #c2_0080
kirishima: "That was a joke." || 今のは冗談だ。  #c2_0081
> Nobody laughs. He seems satisfied anyway.  #c2_0082
@hideall

== c2_lesson | Kendo, explained
@bgm daily
> At the water break after warm-ups, the dojo door slides open a few inches, and Hoshikawa's head comes around it, followed by a sketchbook.  #c2_0083
@show rika school_grin l
rika: "Nacchan! Art club assignment! 'People in motion'! Can I draw you? Can I sit here? Is this a floor you're allowed to sit on?" || なっちゃん！ 美術部の課題！「動いている人」！ 描いていい？ ここ座っていい？ この床って、座っていい床？  #c2_0084
kirishima(calm): "Shoes off." || 靴を脱げ。  #c2_0085
rika<surprised>: "Yes, sir!" || はいっ！  #c2_0086
> She sits against the wall in her socks with the sketchbook on her knees.  #c2_0087
rika<scheme>: "Okay. Explain everything. All I know is you guys yell." || じゃあ、全部説明して。あたし、みんなが叫んでることしか知らないの。  #c2_0088
> Two minutes later she's wiped the practice schedule off the whiteboard by the door, borrowed a pair of glasses from the lost-and-found box, and picked up a {shinai|bamboo practice sword} to point with.  #c2_0090
@show natsuki teach_smile c
kohei(deadpan): "Whose glasses are those?" || その眼鏡、誰のだ。  #c2_0091
natsuki: "Lost and found. How do I look?" || TODO  #c2_0092
natsuki<point>: "Kendo, lesson one. There are four places you're allowed to hit." || 剣道、第一回。打っていい場所は、四つあります。  #c2_0093
> She draws a stick figure on the board. It has an enormous head.  #c2_0094
natsuki<point>: "Men. The head." || 面。頭。  #c2_0095
natsuki<point>: "Kote. The wrist. Usually the right one." || 小手。手首。ふつうは右。  #c2_0096
natsuki<point>: "Dō. The side of the body." || 胴。おなかの横。  #c2_0097
natsuki<point>: "And tsuki, the throat. Thrusts only. You're not allowed to use it until high school." || それから、突き。のど。突きだけ。高校生になるまで、使っちゃだめなの。  #c2_0098
rika<surprised>: "We're in high school!" || あたしたち、高校生じゃん！  #c2_0099
natsuki<smile>: "So be afraid." || だから、こわがってね。  #c2_0100
rika<scheme>: "How do you get a point? Do you just hit them really hard?" || どうやったら点になるの？ 思いっきり叩けばいいの？  #c2_0101
natsuki<point>: "Me-e-en!" || TODO
> Her front foot stamps the floor in the same instant, and the shinai stops an inch short of the stick figure's head.
natsuki<smile>: "Hitting isn't enough. Voice, sword and feet, all at once. {Ki-ken-tai|spirit, sword and body as one}." || TODO  #c2_0102
rika<grin>: "So the yelling is you telling them where." || じゃあ、叫ぶのは、どこを打つか教えてあげてるんだ。  #c2_0103
kohei(annoyed): "That's not why you—" || そういう理由じゃ……  #c2_0105
natsuki<point>: "And afterward, you stay ready. {Zanshin|remaining mind}. No celebrating. You're still in the fight until somebody tells you you're not." || それと、打ったあとも気を抜かない。残心。喜んじゃだめ。終わりって言われるまでは、まだ勝負の途中。  #c2_0106
rika<surprised>: "Who tells you?" || 誰が言うの？  #c2_0107
natsuki<point>: "The referee. Pop quiz, Rika. I hit Fujisawa on the head. What does the referee say?" || TODO  #c2_0108
rika<grin>: "'Ow!'" || TODO
natsuki<smile>: "'Men ari.' There was a head." || TODO
rika<grin>: "Somebody hits you in the head, and the referee goes, 'There was a head.'" || 頭叩かれて、審判が「頭がありました」って言うの？  #c2_0109
rika<scheme>: "What's the hardest one?" || 一番難しいのは？  #c2_0111
natsuki<smile>: "Debana. You hit them right as they start to attack. It's my favorite." || TODO  #c2_0112
rika<surprised>: "How do you know when they're starting?" || 打とうとしてるって、どうやってわかるの？  #c2_0113
natsuki<smile>: "Mostly you don't. That's why it's hard." || たいていは、わからない。だから難しいの。  #c2_0114
@show takatsuki kendo_calm r
takatsuki: "It is the hardest thing in kendo to do on purpose." || 狙ってやるのが、剣道で一番難しい技だ。  #c2_0115
natsuki<point>: "Thank you, Takatsuki-kun. Which brings us to the correct stance. Takatsuki-kun, would you be our model?" || ありがと、たかつきくん。というわけで、正しい構え。たかつきくん、モデルお願いできる？  #c2_0116
takatsuki: "…If it's educational." || ……教育のためなら。  #c2_0117
> He steps out and settles into {kamae|stance} like a door swinging shut. Left heel just off the floor. Sword tip at the height of an imaginary throat. Not one thing out of place.  #c2_0118
natsuki<smile>: "Beautiful. Look at that left heel. And now, for comparison: Fujisawa." || きれい。左のかかと、見て。じゃあ次は、比較のために、ふじさわ。  #c2_0119
kohei(annoyed): "No." || 断る。  #c2_0120
natsuki<point>: "The class is waiting." || みんな待ってるよ。  #c2_0121
rika<grin>: "Fu-ji-sa-wa! Fu-ji-sa-wa!" || ふーじさわ！ ふーじさわ！  #c2_0122
> I get up. I don't know why I get up.  #c2_0123
> I take kamae next to Takatsuki, and Mizuno walks a slow circle around me with the shinai, like a museum guide.  #c2_0124
natsuki<point>: "Left heel, a little low. The tip wanders. He hits men from the wrong distance and gets away with it, which is the worst possible thing for a first-year to see." || 左のかかと、ちょっと低め。剣先がふらふら。面を打つ間合いがおかしいのに、それで決まっちゃう。一年生には一番見せちゃいけないやつ。  #c2_0125
rika<grin>: "He's the 'before' picture!" || ビフォーの写真だ！  #c2_0126
kohei(annoyed): "Hoshikawa. Don't draw that." || TODO  #c2_0127
natsuki<smile>: "You're doing great, visual aid." || いい感じだよ、教材。  #c2_0128
takatsuki: "Mizuno. For the record, your explanation of zanshin was incomplete." || みずの。念のため言っておくが、残心の説明が不十分だった。  #c2_0130
natsuki<smile>: "Incomplete how?" || TODO  #c2_0131
kirishima(calm): "Mizuno. The practice schedule was on that board." || みずの。その板には、練習の予定が書いてあった。  #c2_0132
natsuki<smile>: "…I'll put it back." || ……戻しておきます。  #c2_0133
kirishima(calm): "From memory." || 記憶でな。  #c2_0134
natsuki<smile>: "From memory." || 記憶で。  #c2_0135
@hideall

== c2_match | The practice match
@bgm practice
> After the break, {bogu|armor}. The {men|helmet} goes on last: the {tenugui|cotton head cloth} tied tight over my hair, the helmet settled down over it, the cords pulled and knotted behind my head. The world narrows to a rectangle behind the grille.  #c2_0292
> An hour of kirikaeshi and waza drills later, Kirishima-senpai calls the matches.  #c2_0136
> Mizuno faces me across the floor. Through the bars of her men I can see her eyes, and nothing else, and they're bright.  #c2_0137
> We bow. We step in. We crouch at the line, shinai tips crossing.  #c2_0138
@insert ins_match
@panel Page 1, wide (21:9): the two of them crouched at the line, shinai tips crossed; Kirishima standing to one side as referee; club members kneeling along the wall.
kirishima: "Hajime! (Begin!)" || はじめ！  #c2_0139
@panel Page 1 (4:3): Kōhei, seen past Natsuki's shoulder, lifts his sword tip as if to strike her head. Natsuki hasn't moved at all; her tip stays on his throat.
> I show her men. She doesn't even blink.  #c2_0140
@panel Page 1 (16:9): Kōhei commits, stepping in hard with his arms going up for men. Natsuki's sword is already moving toward his wrist.
> I stop. Half a second. Then I go.  #c2_0141
@panel Page 2, large (top half): her strike lands on his right wrist as his arms come up.
natsuki: "Kote-e-e!" || こてぇぇっ！  #c2_0142
@panel Page 2 (4:3): Kirishima's arm raised toward Natsuki's side.
kirishima: "Kote ari! (Point: wrist!)" || 小手あり！  #c2_0143
@panel Page 2 (4:5): close on Kōhei's eyes behind his grille, a bead of sweat.
> She was there before I moved.  #c2_0144
@panel Page 2 (4:3): close on Natsuki behind her grille, laughing, out of breath.
> She's laughing behind her men.  #c2_0145
@panel Page 2, wide (21:9): back at the line, tips crossed again.
kirishima: "Nihonme! (Second point!)" || 二本目！  #c2_0146
> This time I don't think.  #c2_0147
@panel Page 3, large (top half): Natsuki comes in for his head; Kōhei drops under it as it comes, low, left foot forward (the wrong foot), cutting across her body as they pass.
kohei: "Dō-o-o!" || どぉぉっ！  #c2_0148
@panel Page 3, wide (21:9): the two of them past each other; Kirishima's arm raised toward Kōhei's side.
kirishima: "Dō ari! (Point: body!)" || 胴あり！  #c2_0149
kirishima: "Yame! (Stop!) …That's time." || やめ！ ……時間だ。  #c2_0150
@insert end
> We step back to the line. We bow. I'm breathing like I just ran up the shrine stairs twice.  #c2_0151

== c2_debrief | One sentence each
@bg bg_dojo
> Practice ends the way it starts, with a bow. Bogu off, we kneel in a line while Kirishima-senpai walks down it, saying one sentence to each of us.  #c2_0152
@show kirishima kendo_calm l
kirishima: "Mizuno. Good kote. You drop your left shoulder before men. Fix it." || みずの。いい小手だった。面の前に左肩が下がる。直せ。  #c2_0153
@show natsuki kendo_surprised r
natsuki: "Yes, Captain." || はい、主将。  #c2_0154
kirishima: "Fujisawa." || ふじさわ。  #c2_0155
kohei(neutral): "Captain." || はい、主将。  #c2_0156
kirishima<stern>: "You stopped for half a second. Don't." || 半秒、止まったな。止まるな。  #c2_0157
kohei(serious): "…Yes, Captain." || ……はい、主将。  #c2_0158
@hide kirishima
@show natsuki kendo_grin
> He moves on down the line. Mizuno leans over before I can get up, her face still flushed from the men.  #c2_0159
natsuki<smirk>: "You didn't let me have that point, did you?" || TODO  #c2_0160
kohei(neutral): "No." || ああ。  #c2_0161
natsuki<grin>: "I know. That's why I'm so happy." || 知ってる。だから、こんなにうれしいの。  #c2_0162
@show takatsuki kendo_calm c
takatsuki: "That was debana-kote." || 今のは、出ばな小手だった。  #c2_0164
takatsuki: "You did not take his feint, and you were on his wrist the moment he lifted. I have faced Fujisawa for a year. I have never once been there first." || ふじさわの誘いに乗らずに、振りかぶった瞬間に小手を取った。僕は一年間ふじさわと稽古してきたが、先を取れたことは一度もない。  #c2_0166
natsuki<laugh>: "New-girl luck. It wears off by Friday." || 転校生ボーナスだよ。金曜には切れるから。  #c2_0167
takatsuki: "Luck is not a technique." || 運は、技ではない。  #c2_0168
> She laughs again and finds something on her hakama that needs fixing.  #c2_0169
takatsuki: "And Fujisawa. Your left foot was forward on that dō." || それと、ふじさわ。あの胴、左足が前に出ていた。  #c2_0170
kohei(neutral): "It scored." || 一本は一本だ。  #c2_0171
takatsuki: "Yes." || そうだ。  #c2_0172
