== c2_mop | The mop race
@bg bg_dojo_evening
> Until the first-years join, the floor belongs to whoever stays after practice. It's usually me.  #c2_0174
> Today, Mizuno stays too.  #c2_0175
@show natsuki kendo_grin c
natsuki: "New member. I'm supposed to do the grunt work, right?" || 新入りだからね。雑用はやる決まりでしょ？  #c2_0176
kohei(neutral): "First-years are supposed to do the grunt work." || 雑用は一年の仕事だ。  #c2_0177
natsuki<smile>: "Then I'm a spiritual first-year. Hand me a rag." || じゃあ、心は一年生。雑巾ちょうだい。  #c2_0178
> We do the floor the old way: wet {zōkin|floor cloths}, both hands flat on the wood, running bent double down the length of the dojo and back. She's fast at it. She's also, I notice, trying to beat me to the far wall.  #c2_0179
natsuki<grin>: "Fujisawa! Race you!" || ふじさわ！ 競争ね！  #c2_0180
kohei(deadpan): "It's not a race." || TODO  #c2_0181
@hide natsuki
